cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the thesis below."
title: "Synthetic Mobility Data: A User-Level Membership Inference Assessment"
abstract: >-
  Code evaluating the privacy-utility trade-off of deep generative models
  (VAE, WGAN-GP) trained on origin-destination trips derived from the GeoLife
  GPS dataset, with a user-level membership inference attack measuring privacy
  leakage and a bootstrap resampling generator as a positive control.
type: software
